 <h3><u>Paani ley aawo</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Paani ley aawo</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>Jaan sakina ki jab aayi labo(n) par,</font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>Suka huwa mashkiza layi wo muztar,</p> <p>(Dekha bari yaas se bachi ne chacha ko) x2,</p> <p>daste adab jhor ke kehne lagi rokar,</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>lelo mashko alam tumko meri qasam,</li>
    <p>awo diladu me izne shehe umam,</p>
    <p>rakhlo sakina ka ye maa(n)</p>
    <p>(paani layawo amu jaa(n)) x3</p>
    <li>hasrat he yaas is darja pyaas hai,</li>
    <p>(kya meri pyaas ka tumko ehsas hai) x2</p>
    <p>ayi labo(n) pe ab ye jaa(n)</p>
    <p>(paani layawo amu jaa(n)) x3</p>
    <li>bache tashnajigar bethe hai nawha ghar,</li>
    <p>(pyaas ke chhale hai in sab ke honto par) x2</p>
    <p>pyaaso(n) ke tumho nigehbaa(n)</p>
    <p>(paani layawo amu jaa(n)) x3</p>
    <li>alatash ki sada sunti hai alqama,</li>
    <p>(sunte hai mashkize nawha sakina ka) x2</p>
    <p>gar tumko pyaaso(n) ka hai dhya(n)</p>
    <p>(paani layawo amu jaa(n)) x3</p>
    <li>nazish-e-karbala tumho fakhre wafa,</li>
    <p>(pyaaso(n) ki aas ho phuphiyo(n) ki ho rida) x2</p>
    <p>lillah sherena yazda(n)</p>
    <p>(paani layawo amu jaa(n)) x3</p>
    <li>jawo hafiz khuda misle khaybar khusha,</li>
    <p>(darya ko cheen kar bharlena mashkiza) x2</p>
    <p>bazuwe sayede zeesha(n)</p>
    <p>(paani layawo amu jaa(n)) x3</p>
    <li>wada nibhana hai darya pe jaana hai</li>
    <p>(paani bhi lana tumko bhi aana hai) x2</p>
    <p>tum mujhpe me tumpe qurba(n)</p>
    <p>(paani layawo amu jaa(n)) x3</p>
    <li>sakina meri pyaari sakina, sakina, meri pyari sakina</li>
    <p>sunkar bhatiji ki baat shere jari,</p>
    <p>(bola qurban hai tumpar ye jaa(n) meri) x2</p>
    <p>tum jo kehti ho meri jaa(n)</p>
    <p>(paani layawo amu jaa(n)) x3</p>
    <li>mange mazhar dua rab-e-mushkilkhusha,</li>
   </ol> <p>(roze mehshar kahe tujhse khayrun nisa) x2</p> <p>nawha suna wohi irfa(n)</p> <p>(paani layawo amu jaa(n)) x3</p></font>
